  "cue_count": 85,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 8.26,
      "text": "The Katie Freeway in Texas connects Houston's western suburbs with the city's downtown.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126289,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.02626
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 8.26,
      "end": 13.6,
      "text": "At its widest point right here, it spans 26 lanes including parallel roads, before it",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126289,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.02626
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 13.6,
      "end": 18.68,
      "text": "intersects with another freeway, creating this massive web of pavement.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126289,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.02626
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 18.68,
      "end": 23.28,
      "text": "The Katie Freeway is among the widest in the world, but it didn't start out this big.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126289,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.02626
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 23.28,
      "end": 28.46,
      "text": "The freeway was initially built in the 1960s with six lanes in most places, but as the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126289,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.02626
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 28.46,
      "end": 33.82,
      "text": "suburbs and office space around Houston started growing in the 1980s and 90s, and more people",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166421,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 33.82,
      "end": 37.34,
      "text": "began using the freeway, it became a traffic nightmare.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166421,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 37.34,
      "end": 41.98,
      "text": "By 2004, it was ranked the second worst bottleneck in the country.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166421,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 41.98,
      "end": 46.1,
      "text": "To accommodate the growing commuter class, the city began a nearly $3 billion dollar",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166421,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 46.1,
      "end": 49.94,
      "text": "expansion project to add the additional lanes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166421,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 49.94,
      "end": 55.78,
      "text": "The solution seems natural, more lanes equals less congestion, but traffic didn't get any",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166421,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 55.78,
      "end": 56.78,
      "text": "better.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166421,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 56.78,
      "end": 62.22,
      "text": "In fact, it got worse in both the morning and afternoon commutes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.151348,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 62.22,
      "end": 67.5,
      "text": "The reason why hinges on a simple economic theory, one that is often overlooked because",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.151348,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 67.5,
      "end": 75.77,
      "text": "actually reducing traffic is far from simple.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.151348,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 75.77,
      "end": 80.05,
      "text": "Highway expansion has gone hand in hand with the suburbanization of American cities like",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.151348,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 80.05,
      "end": 81.37,
      "text": "Houston.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.151348,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 81.37,
      "end": 84.53,
      "text": "It becomes a self-fulfilling recipe for urban sprawl.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.151348,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 84.53,
      "end": 89.25,
      "text": "A highway gets built to connect suburbs to a city center, which encourages more development",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.151348,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 89.25,
      "end": 95.17,
      "text": "along it, which necessitates even more highways when those get congested, and on and on and",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.120236,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026749
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 95.17,
      "end": 96.17,
      "text": "on.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.120236,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026749
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 96.17,
      "end": 100.33,
      "text": "The instinct to widen highways to relieve traffic makes sense, but there's a reason",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.120236,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026749
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 100.33,
      "end": 104.09,
      "text": "it doesn't work, due to a concept called induced demand.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.120236,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026749
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 104.09,
      "end": 109.65,
      "text": "These represent three highway lanes, and these balls are the commuters that drive on them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.120236,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026749
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 109.65,
      "end": 114.41,
      "text": "These particular commuters, the red ones, will sit in traffic no matter how bad it gets,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.120236,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026749
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 114.41,
      "end": 115.57,
      "text": "because they have to.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.120236,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026749
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 115.57,
      "end": 118.57,
      "text": "Driving to work on the highway is their only option.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.120236,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026749
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 118.57,
      "end": 121.93,
      "text": "This is what congestion looks like during peak rush hours.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123216,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 121.93,
      "end": 126.57,
      "text": "Once a certain number of cars get on the highway, traffic slows to a crawl.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123216,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 126.57,
      "end": 128.65,
      "text": "Now let's add a new lane.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123216,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 128.65,
      "end": 132.73,
      "text": "These drivers now have more room to spread out, which should make traffic flow better.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123216,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 132.73,
      "end": 137.01,
      "text": "That might happen at first, but it doesn't stay that way.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123216,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 137.01,
      "end": 140.33,
      "text": "That's because there's another set of people who will take the highway under the right",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123216,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 140.33,
      "end": 144.13,
      "text": "conditions, even though they have other commuting options.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123216,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 144.13,
      "end": 148.05,
      "text": "When a highway is congested, they might take local roads instead.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123216,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 148.05,
      "end": 150.93,
      "text": "Or be able to drive during off-peak hours.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127808,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 150.93,
      "end": 154.97,
      "text": "They might use other modes of transportation like public transit, or biking, or maybe",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127808,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 154.97,
      "end": 158.13,
      "text": "they can work from home that day and skip the commute altogether.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127808,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 158.13,
      "end": 163.09,
      "text": "In a few years, these people will start taking the highway, enticed by less congestion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127808,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 163.09,
      "end": 165.09,
      "text": "This is induced demand at play.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127808,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 165.09,
      "end": 169.37,
      "text": "The more supply there is, the more demand will follow, to exhaustion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127808,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 169.37,
      "end": 171.93,
      "text": "And in this case, the supply is highway lanes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127808,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 171.93,
      "end": 175.77,
      "text": "And sometimes, like on the Katy Freeway, congestion gets even worse after a highway",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127808,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 175.77,
      "end": 180.69,
      "text": "expansion, until some of the people with more options go back to their old ways.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128981,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 180.69,
      "end": 184.61,
      "text": "But in the end, you're still left with more drivers, in congestion that's at least as",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128981,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 184.61,
      "end": 187.73,
      "text": "bad as it was before.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128981,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 187.73,
      "end": 193.69,
      "text": "When our transportation system is so reliant on highways and private automobiles, there's",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128981,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 193.69,
      "end": 199.25,
      "text": "almost no way around it, because that's the system that we've created.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128981,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 199.25,
      "end": 202.13,
      "text": "This is Kyle Shelton, an urbanist based in Houston.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128981,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 202.13,
      "end": 209.01,
      "text": "The endless reduction of congestion, should that be the driving policy question for a",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.178595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008575
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 209.01,
      "end": 211.33,
      "text": "lot of our transportation funding?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.178595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008575
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 211.33,
      "end": 215.61,
      "text": "Big expensive highway infrastructure projects are still the prevailing band-aid to congestion",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.178595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008575
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 215.61,
      "end": 217.05,
      "text": "in the U.S.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.178595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008575
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 217.05,
      "end": 223.57,
      "text": "The Transit Advocacy Group Transportation for America found that between 1993 and 2017,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.178595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008575
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 223.57,
      "end": 229.09,
      "text": "the U.S. added over 30,000 miles of new freeway lanes in 100 metro areas.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.178595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008575
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 229.09,
      "end": 233.69,
      "text": "Adding more highways may provide some short-term relief, and it's easier than most infrastructure",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.136783,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.085022
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 233.69,
      "end": 236.45,
      "text": "projects to get federal funding to do a highway expansion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.136783,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.085022
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 236.45,
      "end": 242.85,
      "text": "But if we want less traffic and fewer drivers, giving flexible commuters better choices is",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.136783,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.085022
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 242.85,
      "end": 244.57,
      "text": "a good place to start.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.136783,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.085022
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 244.57,
      "end": 249.09,
      "text": "Like by improving public transit by adding more and better bus routes or trains.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.136783,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.085022
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 249.09,
      "end": 251.85,
      "text": "That alone might not be a silver bullet for congestion relief.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.136783,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.085022
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 251.85,
      "end": 255.93,
      "text": "For the same reason that adding another lane isn't, new drivers will take the place of",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.136783,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.085022
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 255.93,
      "end": 257.45,
      "text": "transit commuters on the highway.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.136783,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.085022
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 257.97,
      "end": 262.69,
      "text": "And for many people living off highways and sprawling U.S. cities, public transit may never",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001455
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 262.69,
      "end": 264.05,
      "text": "be an adequate solution.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001455
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 264.05,
      "end": 268.01,
      "text": "Because it's not just about the infrastructure, it's also about individual behaviors, it's",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001455
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 268.01,
      "end": 273.49,
      "text": "about where job opportunities are located, and most of our cities have now been constructed",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001455
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 273.49,
      "end": 278.97,
      "text": "in this way where the car is the prime mode.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001455
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 278.97,
      "end": 283.53,
      "text": "Another option is to enact policies that actively disincentivize people from using the highway,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001455
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 283.53,
      "end": 288.49,
      "text": "like congestion pricing, which charges people who drive on highways during rush hours, or",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130185,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.125854
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 288.49,
      "end": 293.37,
      "text": "remote work programs that deter people from traveling during the highest traffic times,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130185,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.125854
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 293.37,
      "end": 295.69,
      "text": "or make it so they don't have to commute at all.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130185,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.125854
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 295.69,
      "end": 299.93,
      "text": "And in the long term, better land use policies can help as well, like by building communities",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130185,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.125854
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 299.93,
      "end": 302.85,
      "text": "that put people closer to where they need to go.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130185,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.125854
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 302.85,
      "end": 308.21,
      "text": "And if building more highways results in more drivers than congestion, then removing them",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130185,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.125854
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 308.21,
      "end": 310.81,
      "text": "could have the opposite effect.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130185,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.125854
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 310.81,
      "end": 316.09,
      "text": "For example, the city of Boston removed a freeway in its city center in the 1990s and",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128508,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 316.09,
      "end": 320.41,
      "text": "replaced it with a boulevard with biking and bus lanes and more space to walk.",
